**/node_modules
**/dist
**/*.log
.git
**/.gitignore
**/README.md
**/.env
**/.env.example
price-bot/Dockerfile
price-bot/.dockerignore

# Local capture artifacts and trained weights must never be baked into the
# image: the container collects its own data onto the mounted disk, and a
# committed model.pkl would ship a model trained on someone else's machine.
**/live-prices.json
**/prices.json
**/signals.json
**/model.pkl
**/__pycache__
**/.venv
**/.pytest_cache
